OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #4.7m to tackle
OL,4,Arough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dorset council has been given nearly
OL,7,F#5m in government funding to help
OL,8,Fpeople sleeping rough find safe
OL,9,Faccommodation.
OL,11,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,12,F(BCP) Council was awarded #4.7m as part
OL,13,Fof a new national rough sleeping
OL,14,Fprogramme.
OL,16,FIt builds on #340m announced by Prime
OL,17,FMinister Andy Burnham when he took
OL,18,Foffice, with a further #100m added this
OL,19,Fmonth, bringing the total to #442m over
OL,20,Fthree years.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
