OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #4.7m to tackle
OL,4,Arough sleeping
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the money would fund
OL,7,Fsupported housing and longer-term
OL,8,Fhomes, as well as wraparound services
OL,9,Fto help people rebuild their lives.
